Package: Randomize
Type: Package
Title: Randomization-Based Inference for Introductory Statistics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Brian", "Yurk", email = "yurk@hope.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Jamovi module and R package for teaching randomization-based
    statistical inference. Provides permutation tests (two-sample means,
    paired means, slopes, proportions, chi-square) and bootstrap confidence
    intervals (single mean, difference in means, paired means, slope,
    proportions), plus a model-based calculator. Analyses can be run
    interactively in Jamovi or programmatically from R, with convenience
    functions for extracting plots and tables into Quarto, R Markdown,
    or other documents.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/byurk/Randomize
BugReports: https://github.com/byurk/Randomize/issues
